## Tools

- [SuperTool](https://mxtoolbox.com/SuperTool.aspx): Run any of our 30+ lookups against a domain or IP from a single page.
- [Domain Health](https://mxtoolbox.com/DomainHealth.aspx): All-in-one report covering DNS, mail server, web server, and blacklist status.
- [MX Lookup](https://mxtoolbox.com/MXLookup.aspx): Display the MX records for a domain.
- [Blacklist Check](https://mxtoolbox.com/blacklists.aspx): Check whether a domain or IP is on 100+ DNS blacklists.
- [SPF Lookup](https://mxtoolbox.com/spf.aspx): Validate a domain's SPF record.
- [DKIM Lookup](https://mxtoolbox.com/dkim.aspx): Validate a domain's DKIM selector record.
- [DMARC Lookup](https://mxtoolbox.com/dmarc.aspx): Validate a domain's DMARC policy record.
- [BIMI Lookup](https://mxtoolbox.com/bimi.aspx): Validate a domain's BIMI record and logo.
- [MTA-STS Lookup](https://mxtoolbox.com/mta-sts.aspx): Validate a domain's MTA-STS configuration.
- [TLS-RPT Lookup](https://mxtoolbox.com/tlsrpt.aspx): Validate a domain's SMTP TLS Reporting record.
- [LLMs.txt Lookup](https://mxtoolbox.com/llmstxt.aspx): Validate a domain's /llms.txt file for AI agent discoverability.
- [Email Header Analyzer](https://mxtoolbox.com/EmailHeaders.aspx): Parse and analyze raw email headers.

